Register Code Editor smoke tests in main.ts

Imports and registers all customization and SageMaker extension test
suites. Server behavior, embedding, extension-loading, and SageMaker
tests are gated behind --web flag. Simplifies test setup for reh-web
environment (removes unused Electron/multiroot/extension-host-restart
imports, streamlines repository setup).
